    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "ec67bbe2-3664-4d8e-ac3e-81b90282a84c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E4* central Eastbourne hotel\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAll excursion travel \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEntrance fees to non-National Trust properties included\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBlue Badge guide on Days 2 to 4\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "6ebe47d9-e3cd-477f-947a-40f5df3b2987",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe stay four nights on a half board basis at the 4* Hydro Hotel in Eastbourne (\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.hydrohotel.com\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003Ewww.hydrohotel.com\u003C/a\u003E). Facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and an outdoor heated swimming pool. All rooms are en suite and feature a hairdryer, television, telephone, an in-room safe, and tea \u0026amp; coffee making facilities.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a00f052f-2581-4b24-a04e-a49db5a87615",
      "key": "7af2bdb3-8d18-4845-b587-df75acbb5398",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "For more information on this tour contact your Group Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have received your Confirmation and Invoice, you can pay your final balance.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "d5afb8f7-8e34-41b5-b20f-5f4d7dfd398a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDown House\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBrighton Pavilion \u2013 guided tour\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMichelham Priory \u2013 guided tour\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EScotney Castle\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBateman\u2019s\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECharleston House\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ELewes\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EFarley Farm House \u2013 guided tour\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBerwick Church \u2013 guided tour\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEastbourne\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EChartwell\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "7d896d01-23af-4b9d-8870-363981b561f4",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "In this page"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyNavigationInPageItems",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "4f1687e1-2777-44b7-9469-b8504951bca8",
            "ec67bbe2-3664-4d8e-ac3e-81b90282a84c",
            "6ebe47d9-e3cd-477f-947a-40f5df3b2987",
            "d5afb8f7-8e34-41b5-b20f-5f4d7dfd398a",
            "b9f226ec-68be-4a37-b9bb-cb6551c8e53b",
            "616267c6-a5aa-4b9f-84ab-2f91ef56f3f1",
            "7af2bdb3-8d18-4845-b587-df75acbb5398"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "4f1687e1-2777-44b7-9469-b8504951bca8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe meet our private executive coach at our designated pick up points. En route to our hotel we visit the English Heritage\u2019s Down House, the Home of Charles Darwin. A place of international significance, Down House was the renowned country villa where the great scientist wrote his world changing book \u2018On the Origin of Species\u2019. We continue to the 4* Hydro Hotel in Eastbourne for a four night stay on a half board basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur Blue Badge guide meets us at our hotel this morning and accompanies us throughout the day. This morning we enjoy a guided tour of Brighton Pavilion. Built for the Prince Regent, later King George IV, in stages between 1787 and 1823, the Royal Pavilion is remarkable for its exotic oriental appearance both inside and out. This magnificent royal pleasure palace was revered by fashionable Regency society and is still a distinctive landmark for Brighton today. This afternoon we enjoy a guided tour at Michelham Priory. Founded as an Augustinian priory in 1229, at the dissolution of the monasteries the church was demolished and transformed into a Tudor gentleman\u0026#39;s residence and later a farmhouse. The building was restored in the early part of the 20th century. Set on a moated island, entrance to the property is gained through the imposing 14th century gatehouse.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis morning we visit the National Trust\u2019s Scotney Castle with our Blue Badge guide. The house was designed by Anthony Salvin in Elizabethan style and built in 1837 for Edward Hussey III, while the romantic ruins of a medieval castle and moat are the focal point of the celebrated gardens featuring spectacular displays of rhododendrons, azaleas and kalmia. We visit the National Trust\u2019s Bateman\u2019s property this afternoon. This magnificent 17th century manor house was the home of Rudyard Kipling from 1902 to 1936, and most of the rooms including his book lined study are much as Kipling left them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith our Blue Badge guide we firstly visit Charleston House, the home of the artists Duncan Grant and Vanessa Bell (sister of Virgina Woolf), that became the country meeting place for the group of writers, artists and intellectuals known as the Bloomsbury Group. We then spend some time at leisure for lunch in Lewes. This afternoon we visit Farley Farm House for a guided tour, formerly occupied by the photographer Lee Miller, and the painter and biographer of Picasso, Roland Penrose. The house became a meeting place for leading figures in the world of Modern Art, including Picasso, Max Ernst and Joan Miro, with works by many of these artists on display. We continue to Berwick Church for a guided tour, built on a pre Christian sacred site from where there are magnificent views of the South Downs. The church is well known for the extensive 20th century murals which cover the nave walls, chancel arch, screen and pulpit. These were painted during the Second World War by Duncan Grant, Vanessa Bell and another Bloomsbury artist, Quentin Bell.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter checking out of our hotel, the morning is at leisure in Eastbourne, and on an individual basis you may choose to visit the Towner Art Gallery. Collecting and exhibiting contemporary art for nearly 100 years, the gallery presents historic, modern and contemporary art through temporary and collection based exhibitions. We then continue to the National Trust\u2019s Chartwell property, the family home of Sir Winston Churchill from 1924 until the end of his life. The rooms and gardens remain much as they were when he lived there and contain personal memorabilia, books and family photographs. Taking carefully selected comfort stops en route we return back to our original pick up points.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ENB:- Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational\nreasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will be involved, and this holiday may not be suitable for those with mobility problems.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
